        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_Z0b0YN3OEfCnePj6nExWUA" name="&lt;&lt;decorator>>" isLeaf="true">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_Z0b0Yd3OEfCnePj6nExWUA">
            <body>This element represents the component responsible for applying the @static_config
decorator to a user-defined configuration class.

Its responsibilities are:

- Validating that the class complies with the StaticConfigInterface contract.

- Collecting the Data definitions declared by the user.

- Injecting the required inheritance from StaticConfigBase.

This is not an instantiable class and does not participate in the runtime lifecycle.
It operates exclusively at definition time (import time) as a structural transformation mechanism.</body>
          </ownedComment>
